ntication and ID-token validation to probe internal hosts, metadata endpoints or local files, or exhaust request threads for denial of service.","score":5.3,"sev":"medium","published":"2026-10-03T14:16:39.140Z","modified":"2026-10-06T15:18:12.170Z","window_date":"2026-10-03","activity_at":"2026-10-03T15:30:26Z","date_basis":"GitHub advisory publication","affected":[],"refs":[{"label":"NVD record","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-105122","source":"NVD"},{"label":"CVE Program record","url":"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-105122","source":"CVE Program"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/OpenIdentityPlatform/OpenAM/security/advisories/GHSA-g7cv-hh35-cc7c","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openam-before-16.1.3-ssrf-via-openid-connect-client-jwks-uri","source":"NVD"},{"label":"GitHub security advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-r8x8-66rr-q5w2","source":"GitHub"}],"related_cves":[],"advisories":[{"label":"GitHub Security Advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-r8x8-66rr-q5w2"}],"sources":["NVD","GitHub Advisory Database"],"kev":null,"primary_url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-105122","cvss_vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X","cwe":["CWE-918"]},{"id":"CVE-2026-105121","title":"OpenAM before 16.1.3 contains an improper authorization vulnerability that allows delegated administrators to destroy sessions outside their realms because realm checks use the…","desc":"OpenAM before 16.1.3 contains an improper authorization vulnerability that allows delegated administrators to destroy sessions outside their realms because realm checks use the requester's realm. Authenticated accounts holding the iplanet-am-session-destroy-sessions attribute can supply a target session identifier or handle to forcibly log out users in any realm.","score":6.9,"sev":"medium","published":"2026-10-03T14:16:38.997Z","modified":"2026-10-06T15:18:12.170Z","window_date":"2026-10-03","activity_at":"2026-10-03T15:30:26Z","date_basis":"GitHub advisory publication","affected":[],"refs":[{"label":"NVD record","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-105121","source":"NVD"},{"label":"CVE Program record","url":"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-105121","source":"CVE Program"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/OpenIdentityPlatform/OpenAM/security/advisories/GHSA-hmwh-9r8r-44gw","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openam-before-16.1.3-improper-authorization-in-delegated-session-destroy-realm-scoping","source":"NVD"},{"label":"GitHub security advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-86x4-hjp8-8h99","source":"GitHub"}],"related_cves":[],"advisories":[{"label":"GitHub Security Advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-86x4-hjp8-8h99"}],"sources":["NVD","GitHub Advisory Database"],"kev":null,"primary_url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-105121","cvss_vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X","cwe":["CWE-285"]},{"id":"CVE-2026-105120","title":"OpenAM before 16.1.3 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability in the sessions REST endpoint query operation that allows realm administrators to list sessions of every realm.","desc":"OpenAM before 16.1.3 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability in the sessions REST endpoint query operation that allows realm administrators to list sessions of every realm. Attackers holding delegated RealmAdmin privileges can supply a _queryFilter naming another realm to disclose usernames, universal IDs, and session handles across tenant boundaries.","score":6.9,"sev":"medium","published":"2026-10-03T14:16:38.853Z","modified":"2026-10-06T15:18:12.170Z","window_date":"2026-10-03","activity_at":"2026-10-03T15:30:25Z","date_basis":"GitHub advisory publication","affected":[],"refs":[{"label":"NVD record","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-105120","source":"NVD"},{"label":"CVE Program record","url":"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-105120","source":"CVE Program"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/OpenIdentityPlatform/OpenAM/security/advisories/GHSA-x8cj-3hqv-cgwh","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openam-before-16.1.3-cross-realm-session-disclosure-via-sessions-rest-endpoint","source":"NVD"},{"label":"GitHub security advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-55ch-4xvx-7w9q","source":"GitHub"}],"related_cves":[],"advisories":[{"label":"GitHub Security Advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-55ch-4xvx-7w9q"}],"sources":["NVD","GitHub Advisory Database"],"kev":null,"primary_url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-105120","cvss_vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X","cwe":["CWE-200"]},{"id":"CVE-2026-105119","title":"OpenAM before 16.1.3 applies its OAuth2 Provider PKCE enforcement only to authorization requests whose response_type is exactly code, so codes issued through OpenID Connect…","desc":"OpenAM before 16.1.3 applies its OAuth2 Provider PKCE enforcement only to authorization requests whose response_type is exactly code, so codes issued through OpenID Connect hybrid flows (code token, code id_token, code token id_token) carry no bound challenge. An attacker who intercepts such a code can redeem it for a public client's tokens with any non-empty code_verifier.","score":7.6,"sev":"high","published":"2026-10-03T14:16:38.710Z","modified":"2026-10-06T17:17:17.240Z","window_date":"2026-10-03","activity_at":"2026-10-03T15:30:25Z","date_basis":"GitHub advisory publication","affected":[],"refs":[{"label":"NVD record","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-105119","source":"NVD"},{"label":"CVE Program record","url":"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-105119","source":"CVE Program"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/OpenIdentityPlatform/OpenAM/security/advisories/GHSA-5p2f-7vcr-6vfh","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openam-before-16.1.3-pkce-enforcement-bypass-via-oauth-2.0-hybrid-flows","source":"NVD"},{"label":"GitHub security advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mf8f-w84m-x4gc","source":"GitHub"}],"related_cves":[],"advisories":[{"label":"GitHub Security Advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mf8f-w84m-x4gc"}],"sources":["NVD","GitHub Advisory Database"],"kev":null,"primary_url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-105119","cvss_vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X","cwe":["CWE-285"]},{"id":"CVE-2026-105118","title":"OpenAM before 16.1.3 contains an open redirect vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to redirect users by supplying an unverified id_token_hint to the…","desc":"OpenAM before 16.1.3 contains an open redirect vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to redirect users by supplying an unverified id_token_hint to the /oauth2/connect/endSession endpoint. Attackers can name any realm client in a forged hint to redirect victims to any registered post-logout URI, enabling phishing that borrows the OpenAM host's trust.","score":2.3,"sev":"low","published":"2026-10-03T14:16:38.563Z","modified":"2026-10-06T15:18:12.170Z","window_date":"2026-10-03","activity_at":"2026-10-03T15:30:25Z","date_basis":"GitHub advisory publication","affected":[],"refs":[{"label":"NVD record","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-105118","sour